{"meta":{"id":"access-modifier","category":"it/syntax/javascript/class","title":"#private · get / set · JS","subtitle":"(JAVASCRIPT)","summary":"# 필드로 진짜 비공개, get / set 접근자 — public/private 키워드는 없음","tags":["javascript","f-class","f-access"],"color":"violet","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-violet","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-violet-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-violet-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-violet-50 text-violet-700 border border-violet-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></span>JAVASCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">#private · get / set · JS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-violet-50/70 border border-violet-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-violet-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> # 필드로 진짜 비공개, get / set 접근자 — public/private 키워드는 없음</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">#private 필드</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">class Account {\r\n  #balance = 0;              // 클래스 밖에서 접근 불가 (실행 시점에도 막힘)\r\n\r\n  deposit(n) { this.#balance += n; }\r\n  #log() { }                 // private 메서드\r\n}\r\nnew Account().#balance;      // SyntaxError</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">JS 에는 public / private / protected 키워드가 없다. <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>#</code> 필드만 진짜 비공개</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">get / set</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">class Temp {\r\n  #c = 0;\r\n  get f() { return this.#c * 9 / 5 + 32; }    // 속성처럼 읽기\r\n  set f(v) { this.#c = (v - 32) * 5 / 9; }    // 속성처럼 쓰기\r\n}\r\nconst t = new Temp();\r\nt.f = 212;\r\nt.f;   // 212</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> 프로그램 언어 › JAVASCRIPT › JS class 상수 정의 (get/set), TypeScript › 접근 제한자</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/javascript/class/access-modifier","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"javascript","title":"JAVASCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/javascript"},{"id":"class","title":"클래스","path":"it/syntax/javascript/class"}],"hasImage":false}